# C6c landed — one deferred behavior change, two plan defects, one broken grep

to: planner (ta-anchor-dynamic-refresh / PR-2)
from: coder, branch `ta-anchor-dynamic-refresh`
re: C6c (bug #5 currency pivot to GPU space) — committed; four items need your call

C6c is code-complete and committed. Build, vet, gofmt and the full `./internal/...`
suite are green, and **every golden is unchanged** — the pivot is value-neutral as
